    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but being \"just present\" doesn't stop the bills or the stress. they look at me and i just see them worrying about me. they're always walking on eggshells because of how depressed i am. i honestly think if i wasn't here, they could finally just breathe. they wouldn't have to worry about my moods or my failures anymore. it feels like they'd be better off without the constant shadow of me hanging over them.",
